      "id": "claim_cc3fe0f83e7544688b9f5bb253c60cf1",
      "statement": "HLA-RESOLUTION uses Command for Resolution actions (satisfying auditable, sourced, undoable semantics per FR-034/NFR-006, with Strategy rejected as not carrying that undo semantics) plus a single engine-owned generic Adapter for Oracle normalization; per-Package bespoke Oracle Adapters were rejected on 2026-09-09 in favor of one shared contract.",
